    {
      "content": "I see. Okay. Yeah, cause from, since we charge by the hour basically it will just really depend on how long the move is gonna take overall. So if you guys are planning to do, you know, everything in one day, then of course the travel time in between the addresses as well will be counted on the hourly rate now it will be just the same rate for the moving itself. So, if you wanna go ahead and just do a separate move then, you know, that's better in terms of the distance because the driving in between the addresses are also counted into the times as well.",
      "name": "Joanna Ballon",
      "time": "2026-10-04T21:28:07.962414",
      "type": "transcript",
