      "time": "2026-10-04T21:28:33.485414",
      "type": "moment",
      "user_id": "4658269278552064"
    },
    {
      "content": "So, just depending on how far you know, we're driving from his address or your address first and then his address as well. But of course the good thing about combining your move is just really depending on the items that you guys are moving in each places because for every move we do have a two and a half hour minimum. So if you guys think that his stuff won't you know, it's just a very minimal, won't take, you know, won't maximise a two and a half hour minimum. Then it's good that we combine it altogether in one day. But of course if his move or his items, furniture, and all that is already sufficient for the twenty and a half hour minimum. Then we can just definitely like break it down into two different moves as well. So we save those times travelling in between locations.",
